step Mordent Evenshade
  tip Each pylon is repaired with the Pile of Pylon Parts that comes with the quest; a repair uses four Coalesced Mana Crystals, gathered from the Unstable Mana Rifts with the Mana Sieve. The Decrepit Pylon Protectors only guard the pylons: killing them is no part of it. Pull the nearest one away and repair from the west side.
